WEBVTT

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.970
What could this be?!

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:10.020
What could it be that boils within my chest?

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.490
It's...

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.320
love.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.900
Love shall disappear!

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.670
Stop it, Daddy!

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:42.710
I think King Selfish stopped mid-punch for a second!

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.890
I heard a heartbeat of love!

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:50.690
King Selfish isn't completely taken over by darkness!

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:54.140
The king's heart is still within him!

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:58.050
Please, Lovely Pad, show us the king!

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.200
Father!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:08.770
That is King Selfish's heart!

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:10.190
He's trapped inside it!

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:15.620
That's my real Daddy...

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:16.830
Okay!

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.660
We'll go save the king!

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:20.700
What?!

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:23.030
By saving him, you mean...

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:26.320
We'll be going inside King Selfish?

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:29.800
That's too crazy, even for you!

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.730
But I guess there's no stopping you.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.680
Can it truly be done?

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:37.040
Sure can!

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:40.520
Who the heck do you think I am?

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:46.880
I'm Oogai First Middle School's Student Council President!

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:53.560
Aida Mana! {echo effects}

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:59.030
Huh?!

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:05.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:10.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.610
Every day it sparkles

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:16.280
Dokidoki Precure

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:23.200
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:28.860
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:34.490
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:39.940
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:45.640
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:54.510
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.190
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.590
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:01.430
Our happy love will change the world

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:04.230
What's more than just cute

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:08.100
is our promise between girls

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:14.140
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:20.040
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:32.060
Hearts Racing at Max Speed!

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:32.060
Hearts Racing at Max Speed!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.370
No way!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:37.440
That girl's the Student Council President?!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:45.050
<i>No wonder they looked so alike!</i>

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:51.550
You can do it, Mana!

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:54.480
I'm right behind ya!

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.020
I'm rootin' too!

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:56.710
Me too!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:00.180
Prez, you can do it!

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:11.530
I doubt even the entire Yotsuba Conglomerate's influence could cover this up...

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:13.460
There's no need to.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.510
Sir!

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:16.800
And Madam!

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:23.350
The Precures are risking their lives to save the world.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.170
Let's all root for them.

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:31.330
You can do it, Precures!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.690
Hey, you shout too!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.390
R-Right!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:41.560
You can do it, Precures!

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.600
Precures!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.450
Do it!

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.440
Don't lose!

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.280
Those voices...

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.160
Doit, Pwecure!

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:15.080
What irritating voices!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:18.590
They make my stomach turn!

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:22.530
Those voices are the people who wish for happiness.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:29.280
The people who love their friends, family, and everything else in the world!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.850
Oh poor king who has lost his love,

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.080
I, Cure Heart,

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:38.330
will make your heart race once more!

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.120
Silence!

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:45.210
I shall extinguish every last one of those voices!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.830
Mana, please save Daddy!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.240
Roger Wilco!

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:01.240
Selfish!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:07.180
I am King Selfish's faithful servant.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:12.390
We'll eliminate all who stand before King Selfish with no mercy!

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:14.360
Ira!

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:15.820
Selfish!

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.260
Sword Hurricane!

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.590
Self!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:24.760
Self?

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:25.730
Gather!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:28.660
Self!

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:30.950
Heart Dynamite!

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.540
Head over heels...

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.580
Regina!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.910
Ace Mirror Flash!

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.460
You two!

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.770
What're you trying to pull?!

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.440
Oh, you still think you call the shots?

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:02.340
We put up with your whining because we considered you King Selfish's daughter,

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:04.140
but that's all over now!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.620
Regina!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.480
You shall not lay a finger on my friend!

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:18.190
Regina, are you all right?

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:20.060
Now let's move on!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.480
Please, Ira!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:28.220
Just let us through!

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:32.030
King Selfish is concentrated Egogy!

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:35.300
Do you have any idea what could happen to you if you went inside?

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:37.150
I do.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:42.300
But Cure Heart said she'd go, so I have to follow.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:45.270
Mana's my best friend, after all!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.020
Friend?

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:57.660
Friends lend a hand when you need it most.

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:00.790
I'm sure you know what that's like.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.340
You and your stupid "friends"!

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.570
Go ahead, see if I care!

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:17.270
To enter King Selfish's body,

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:19.150
we must go through his mouth.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:21.480
I shall create an opening!

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:24.650
Rosetta Balloon!

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.760
A one, two, and three!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:56.580
Laaaaaaaance!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:57.880
Huh?!

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:00.100
What's goin' on?!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.590
L-Lance turned into...

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:04.050
A-A-A giant!

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.040
Wha...

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.910
What a surprise!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:07.600
He's still here!

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:12.070
You dare stand before me?

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.530
Very well, come!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.500
Laaaaaaance!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.810
Get him!

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:24.670
Use that right hook!

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:27.150
He can't reach!

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:29.340
Laaaaaaaance!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:30.530
Look at that!

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:31.700
It's a beam!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:34.430
Not!

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:41.650
Don't bite the ears!

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:43.540
Now is your chance!

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:45.870
Thanks, Rosetta!

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:50.820
Ai!

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.950
Ai wants to save Daddy too, right?

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:58.510
After them!

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.270
Diamond Swirkle!

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:11.690
It's the swallow's duty to help the Happy Prince.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:13.970
I'll handle this, so go on ahead!

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:15.230
Got it!

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:22.870
The king is that way!

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.330
Self...

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:27.570
Selfish!

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:31.050
We'll send you to Davy Jones' Locker! {じゃなイカ, so it's a squid pun}

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:32.270
Baaaaah.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:35.230
This place is swarming with Selfishes too?

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:39.610
It shows how thoroughly Egogy has corrupted Father!

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.910
Ace Shot!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.160
Bang!

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:50.680
You won't be the ones that got away! {more squid puns}

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:56.130
We can't have them following us along!

00:10:57.990 --> 00:10:59.880
I'll hold them off here.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:03.380
Girls, find the king as quickly as you can!

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:05.490
Don't worry.

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.920
I swear I'll catch up!

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:09.390
Cure Sword...

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:17.300
Now hurry!

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:18.590
Girls, let's go!

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.120
Don't <i>ink</i> you'll get away!

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:24.990
You shall not pass...

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:26.570
one step beyond me!

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.320
This is...

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:54.470
King Selfish's heart...

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:57.180
Father!

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:58.020
Daddy!

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:01.840
The Egogy is growing stronger!

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:02.940
Be careful!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:14.760
Who are they?

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:17.180
We are King Selfish's cells. {King Cellfishes}

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:22.260
We eliminate all foreign bacteria that enters King Selfish's body!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.520
Hey, who are you calling bacteria?

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:28.560
Return my father!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.700
Ha! No chance!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:44.540
Well, her stick packs a punch!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.920
You've got no hope!

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:04.510
Do you really think you can beat us inside King Selfish when he's already reached maximum Egogy?

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.020
Cure Diamond!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:23.220
I'm... fine...

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:28.350
I can't let them get to Mana!

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:29.000
Rachel!

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:30.380
Comin' right up!

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:35.830
I'll fight to the bitter end with you, Rikka!

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:39.730
I'll show you our final attack!

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:49.630
Precure Diamond Blizzard!

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:03.590
<i>Mana... it's all up to you.</i>

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.210
Glitter!

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.580
Holy Sword!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.370
Love love looooove!

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:30.070
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:37.290
Love love looooove!

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:12.940
Laaaaaance!

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:17.610
The Lovely Pad can't withstand...

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:19.600
No,

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:22.900
the world is at stake!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.880
We cannot...

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:27.610
afford to lose!

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.800
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:34.080
Laaaaaance!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:42.010
Laaaaaance!

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:47.400
Mana...

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:03.800
Father!

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:05.580
Please, open your eyes!

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.040
He can't hear you!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:11.250
The king's lost his soul!

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.450
That's not true!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:17.530
I heard a heartbeat of love from him!

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:20.740
I know the king still has his soul!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:27.210
The king sacrificed his soul to cure his daughter and gave his psyche to darkness!

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:32.070
Call for him all you want, but he'll never open his eyes...

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:33.510
again!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:06.410
Do not... harm... my family.

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:10.200
The King of Trump awakened?

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:13.120
What a joke.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:17.820
If only you had never voiced your selfish desire to save your daughter,

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:22.320
the citizens of Trump Kingdom would still be living in peace!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:26.520
You obsessed over your family in spite of having a kingdom to run,

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.490
making you the most selfish human in the world!

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:32.680
You sowed the seeds of your own destruction!

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:33.540
You're wrong.

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:39.800
What parent wouldn't want to save his child?

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:43.140
That's not selfish at all!

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:44.980
What?!

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:49.720
Families are pretty great.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:54.400
No matter how down you get, they'll stand by you and make your heart race!

00:17:55.290 --> 00:18:02.770
That's why I want to let Regina, Aguri, and Ai see their father one more time!

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:07.140
And as long as I'm still breathing,

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:10.070
I won't let <i>anyone</i> stop me!

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:12.200
Because I'm...

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:15.450
Oh, I can feel it!

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:18.910
Cure Heart's heartstrings are tied like a knot!

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:22.040
Because I'm brimming with love,

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.590
Cure Heart!

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:35.930
Now's your chance to reach the king!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:36.810
Right!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.470
Family love, huh?

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:45.700
Don't make me laugh.

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:54.680
You think a king who brings his kingdom to ruin over a single girl deserves no punishment?!

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.540
Love is not a crime.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.980
The true criminals are the ones who abused that love:

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:07.290
you!

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:17.970
Daddy!

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:23.320
Daddy!

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:24.560
Daddaa!

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:26.860
Father!

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:36.720
Ange...

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:09.440
K-King... Selfish just...

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:12.300
They... really pulled it off...

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.710
What in the world happened?

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:19.180
The Precures rekindled King Selfish's heart!

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:21.970
Unbelievable!

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:26.950
That gigantic creature completely disappeared right before our very eyes!

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:32.950
You've fulfilled the duty that you've carried since birth...

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.650
Splendid, Aguri.

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.670
Mana! C'mon, Mana!

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:39.520
Mana!

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:44.130
Daddy!

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:44.820
Mommy!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:46.120
Grandpa too?

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.500
Ya did good.

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:48.470
Mana...

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:50.510
we saw everything.

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:52.910
Mana!

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:57.910
Thank you for keeping your promise.

00:20:57.910 --> 00:21:00.650
Mana, I love you!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:02.580
Regina!

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:03.810
Regi—

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:05.340
Prez!

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:08.840
Guys!

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:09.870
Prez!

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.010
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:13.060
You're not injured or anything, right?

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:14.270
Aw, I'm fine!

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:17.230
Man, you had us freakin' out!

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:18.700
Sorry.

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:21.760
Oh no!

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:23.500
Fools...

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:26.230
No darkness disappears forever.

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:32.130
My dear King Selfish,

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:38.850
you achieved a truly magnificent form after your ten thousand year slumber.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:42.570
But worry not.

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:46.580
I would be glad to carry on your legacy.

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:53.230
This makes me Numero Uno!

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:56.330
The human world, Trump Kingdom,

00:21:56.330 --> 00:22:00.970
and every other world will become mine!

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:28.960
<i>Dokidoki Precure's</i> final episode:

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:31.730
From Me to You!

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:31.730
From Me to You!

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:33.760
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
